```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization member --help
Manage Scherzo Cloud organization members

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization member [COMMAND]

Commands:
  history  List organization membership history
  list     List organization members
  remove   Remove an organization member
  update   Update an organization member's role
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

```
